{% comment %}
  The home opener — and the REFERENCE IMPLEMENTATION of supports.heroImagery. Three rules worth
  copying:

  1. EVERY field is optional. Copy derives from brand (| default) or omits; no photos means the
     designed gradient below — never a placeholder image.
  2. Photos are NEVER placed raw. The .lq-homehero--photo treatment in theme.css lays a scrim
     built from the palette variables (color-mix over var(--bg)/var(--primary)), so any uploaded
     photograph is toned into the template. Tune the treatment, don't remove it.
  3. Templates ship no JavaScript, so rotation is the PLATFORM's hero_carousel island: with two
     or more photos, place it and style its documented classes (.hero-slide, .hero-slide-scrim,
     .hero-dots) — the platform owns the motion, you own the look.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign heroCount = section.images | size %}
{% if heroCount == 1 %}
  {% assign heroPhoto = section.images.first.imageUrl %}
{% elsif heroCount == 0 %}
  {% assign heroPhoto = section.imageUrl %}
{% endif %}
<section class="lq-homehero{% if heroPhoto %} lq-homehero--photo{% endif %}{% if heroCount > 1 %} lq-homehero--carousel{% endif %}"{% if heroPhoto %} style="background-image: url('{{ heroPhoto }}')"{% endif %}>
  {% if heroCount > 1 %}{% island 'hero_carousel' %}{% endif %}
  <div class="container lq-homehero-inner">
    <div>
      <p class="lq-kicker">{{ section.eyebrow | default: brand.name }}</p>
      <h1>{{ section.title | default: brand.tagline | default: brand.name }}</h1>
      {% if section.lead %}<p class="lq-homehero-lead">{{ section.lead }}</p>{% endif %}
      <div class="lq-homehero-actions">
        {% if section.givingStyle == 'button' %}
        <a class="button button-primary" href="{{ section.primaryHref | default: '/donate' }}">{{ section.primaryLabel | default: 'Donate now' }}</a>
        {% else %}
        <a class="button button-primary" href="#donate">{{ section.primaryLabel | default: 'Donate now' }}</a>
        {% endif %}
        <a class="button" href="{{ section.secondaryHref | default: '/about' }}">{{ section.secondaryLabel | default: 'Our story' }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% unless section.givingStyle == 'button' %}
    <aside id="donate">
      {% island 'donation_widget' %}
    </aside>
    {% endunless %}
  </div>
</section>
